<title>UK: UK Halifax Feb house price index due Thursday.</title>
<headline>UK Halifax Feb house price index due Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Halifax Building Society said its house price index for February, originally due to be published on Tuesday, will now be published at 0001 GMT on Thursday.</p>
<p>The society said last month that house prices fell 0.6 percent in January, giving a year-on-year increase of 7.1 percent.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774</p>
